正在调用 DeepSeek：SQL Generation……

模型生成的 SQL：
SELECT DISTINCT stadium.Name, stadium.Location
FROM stadium
JOIN concert AS c1 ON stadium.Stadium_ID = c1.Stadium_ID
JOIN concert AS c2 ON stadium.Stadium_ID = c2.Stadium_ID
WHERE c1.Year = 2014 AND c2.Year = 2015;

Gold SQL（仅用于核对）：
SELECT T2.name ,  T2.location FROM concert AS T1 JOIN stadium AS T2 ON T1.stadium_id  =  T2.stadium_id WHERE T1.Year  =  2014 INTERSECT SELECT T2.name ,  T2.location FROM concert AS T1 JOIN stadium AS T2 ON T1.stadium_id  =  T2.stadium_id WHERE T1.Year  =  2015

